# The running gate needs only the dispatcher + per-language shell/rules/lib.
# test-fixtures/ and tests/ are for the bats suite (CI), never at runtime --
# excluding them keeps every image ~340MB slimmer (swift fixtures alone carry
# committed + local .build artifacts). Also drop docs, CI metadata, docker/.
.git
docker
.github
docs
tests
**/test-fixtures
**/*.md
